  "Good morning. Thank you for joining us today. Could you start by introducing yourself and summarizing your experience as a JavaScript engineer?": "good_morning_thank_you_for_joining_us_today_could__501815306.wav",
  "Good morning. Thank you for having me. I am a Senior JavaScript Engineer with several years of experience building web applications, designing scalable frontend systems, and collaborating closely with backend, product, and design teams.": "good_morning_thank_you_for_having_me_i_am_a_senior_1884148086.wav",
