  "I prefer a balanced strategy. Unit tests cover business logic, integration tests validate how modules work together, and end-to-end tests protect the most critical user journeys. I try to avoid overtesting implementation details that create fragile test suites.": "i_prefer_a_balanced_strategy_unit_tests_cover_busi_1978305675.wav",
  "Senior engineers also mentor others. How do you support less experienced developers?": "senior_engineers_also_mentor_others_how_do_you_sup_1892416455.wav",
